slot) or an association from the selected slot IDs to coefficients.", 
   "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Option of AddModularFormCouplings: the per-slot coefficients.", 
   "Notes"], Cell["Automatic (default) makes a fresh coupling per selected \
slot; an association from exactly the selected slot IDs to coefficients uses \
those (declare symbols with ParameterSymbols).", "Notes"], 
  Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["AddModularFormCouplings", 
